\[\bold{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 8 \\ -1 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix} + u \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ -4 \\ 0 \end{pmatrix}\]intersect.  Find the point of intersection.

To find the point of intersection, we need to set the two equations equal to each other and solve for the parameters t and u.  This gives us the following system of equations:
\begin{align*}
